@title Build mode: guided assembly and wiring of a cabinet, tick off, problem, progress
@area Cabinet
# Reports > Build mode: one step at a time with a big Done button, the progress of the cabinet,
# a traffic light per step. The fixture is the cabinet lesson project with door cut-outs.
open qa/fixtures/door-cutouts.novo
wait 20
click_text Reports
wait 5
click_text "Build mode..."
wait 30
expect "Build mode"
expect "Step 1 of"
expect "Check the plate"
shot start
check_blank start
check_layout
click_text "Done" Button
wait 10
expect "Step 2 of"
expect "Drill"
shot after-first-tick
check_layout
click_text "Done" Button
wait 10
click_text "Done" Button
wait 10
shot third-step
check_layout
click_text "Problem…" Button
wait 10
expect "What is wrong?"
shot problem-editor
text Rail is too short
wait 5
click_text "Raise problem" Button
wait 10
expect "1 problem"
shot problem-raised
check_layout
click_text "Back" Button
wait 10
shot back
key Escape
wait 10
expect_not "Step 1 of"
